  wave = {
    ui = {
        float = {
            bg = "none";
        };
    };
  };
  dragon = {
      syn = {
          parameter = "yellow";
      };
  };
  all = {
      ui = {
          bg_gutter = "none";
      };
  };
}
```

The body of a function that add/modify hihlights.
It takes as input a `colors` argument which is a table of this form:
```
  colors = {
    palette = {
      foo = "#RRGGBB",
      bar = "#RRGGBB"
    },
    theme = {
      foo = "#RRGGBB",
      bar = "#RRGGBB"
    }
  }
```
It should return a table of highlights.

```
  function(colors)
    CONTENT_OF_OVERRIDE_OPTION
  end
```

