      },
    },
  })
}
```

Detect file changes: While using @rescript/language-server \>= 1.63.0
you have to detect file changes by registering the didChangeWatchedFiles
hook.

``` lua
capabilities = {
    workspace = {
        didChangeWatchedFiles = {
            dynamicRegistration = true,
        },
    },
}
```.

