options.description:
Whether to enable https://github.com/rust-lang/rls rls, a language server for Rust See
https://github.com/rust-lang/rls#setup to setup rls itself. See
https://github.com/rust-lang/rls#configuration for rls-specific
settings. All settings listed on the rls configuration section of the
readme must be set under settings.rust as follows:

``` lua
vim.lsp.config('rls', {
  settings = {
    rust = {
      unstable_features = true,
      build_on_save = false,
      all_features = true,
    },
  },
})
```

If you want to use rls for a particular build, eg nightly, set cmd as
follows:

``` lua
cmd = {"rustup", "run", "nightly", "rls"}
```.

