automatically populated by the contents of settings\["rust-analyzer"\]
per
https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-analyzer/blob/eb5da56d839ae0a9e9f50774fa3eb78eb0964550/docs/dev/lsp-extensions.md?plain=1#L26..

